  "name": "Nippon Hotel",
  "starRating": 4,
  "descriptions": [
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RXLContentId",
      "text": "479502"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "SurroundingArea",
      "text": "With a stay at Nippon Hotel, you\u0027ll be centrally located in Istanbul, a 6-minute walk from Taksim Square and 11 minutes by foot from Istanbul Congress Center.  This hotel is 1.1 mi (1.8 km) from Madame Tussauds Istanbul and 1.6 mi (2.6 km) from Galata Tower."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "RoomTypes",
      "text": "Make yourself at home in one of the 165 individually decorated guestrooms, featuring minibars and flat-screen televisions. Complimentary wired and wireless internet access keeps you connected, and satellite programming provides entertainment. Private bathrooms with bathtubs or showers feature rainfall showerheads and complimentary toiletries. Conveniences include phones, as well as safes and desks."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PropertyInformation",
      "text": "Take advantage of recreation opportunities such as a fitness center, or other amenities including complimentary wireless internet access and concierge services. This Art Deco hotel also features a television in a common area and a banquet hall."
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "AreaActivities",
      "text": "Distances are displayed to the nearest 0.1 mile and kilometer. \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003Cp\u003EAcibadem Taksim Hospital - 0.4 km / 0.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Taksim Square - 0.5 km / 0.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Istiklal Avenue - 0.6 km / 0.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Vodafone Park - 0.8 km / 0.5 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Istanbul Congress Center - 0.9 km / 0.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Macka Park - 1 km / 0.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Madame Tussauds Istanbul - 1 km / 0.6 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Lutfi Kirdar Convention and Exhibition Centre - 1.1 km / 0.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Dolmabah\u00E7e Palace - 1.1 km / 0.7 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Bosphorus - 1.4 km / 0.9 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Galataport - 1.5 km / 1 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Pera Palace Hotel - 1.9 km / 1.2 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Istanbul Museum of Modern Art - 2.1 km / 1.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E American Hospital - 2.1 km / 1.3 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E Besiktas Pier - 2.2 km / 1.4 mi \u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe nearest airports are:\u003Cbr /\u003EIstanbul Sabiha Gokcen Intl. Airport (SAW) - 62.1 km / 38.6 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E Istanbul Airport (IST) - 39 km / 24.2 mi\u003Cbr /\u003E \u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003EThe preferred airport for Nippon Hotel is Istanbul Airport (IST). \u003C/p\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "PoliciesDisclaimers",
      "text": "\u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EExtra-person charges may apply and vary depending on property policy\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EGovernment-issued photo identification and a credit card or cash deposit may be required at check-in for incidental charges\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESpecial requests are subject to availability upon check-in and may incur additional charges; special requests cannot be guaranteed\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThe name on the credit card used at check-in to pay for incidentals must be the primary name on the guestroom reservation\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EThis property accepts credit cards and cash\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECashless transactions are available\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ESafety features at this property include a fire extinguisher, a security system, a first aid kit, and window guards\u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003EPlease note that cultural norms and guest policies may differ by country and by property; the policies listed are provided by the property\u003C/li\u003E  \u003C/ul\u003E \u003Cul\u003E  \u003Cli\u003EOnly registered guests are allowed in the guestrooms. \u003C/li\u003E \u003Cli\u003EA car is not required for transportation to and from this property. \u003C/li\u003E\u003Cli\u003ECashless payment methods are available for all transactions.\u003C/li\u003E \u003C/ul\u003E"
    },
    {
      "language": "en",
      "type": "DiningFacilities",
      "text": "Grab a bite to eat at Niwa Restoran, one of the hotel\u0027s many dining establishments, which include 2 restaurants and a coffee shop/cafe. Wrap up your day with a drink at the bar/lounge. Buffet breakfasts are available daily from 7 AM to 10:30 AM for a fee."
    }
  ],
